
## Refactor
- [ ] Project's base ui components should be moved to another repository to be shipped separatedly and added as a dependency to this project:
    - Expandable, Popover, Modal, Carousel, Slide, SlideTranslator, Movement are plain purely ui elements, mixin or helpers
    - FalseSelect, FalseSelectDropdown, FalseOption, DynamicChip, DynamicSelector are form-related implementations
    - client custom elements tags and mixin-elements.ts (defines the custom element) should stay where they are (here)
- [ ] DataClient script should live here
- [ ] Cut dependency from general-types.d.ts
- [ ] Move default stylesheets along with components
- [ ] BaseArticle, HashRouter, RoutesDataManager stay here
- [ ] Logger display div refactor from data-client.ts and move to new location (implement as custom element)

